HST Office: Slides ribbon content for 1.0.0, closer to the Office ribbon.

Commands that Slides can run are added on the tab and group where an Office user looks for them (Paste Special,
Change Case, Select, text direction and vertical text alignment, shape fill, outline and shadow on Home; Photo
Album, Action and Object on Insert; Accessibility and proofing language on Review; Macros on View; alignment and
arrange groups on Table Layout; picture and shape commands on their contextual tabs). The Font, Paragraph and
Drawing groups and the shape tab get launchers that open the full dialog. Format Painter and Clear Formatting show
their labels. A new Help tab ("Trợ giúp") sits before "Phần mở rộng"; the Developer tab is merged into "Phần mở
rộng" (macros, extensions and options, form controls), and its tab menu joins the "Phần mở rộng" tab menu.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
